{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28888","headline":"将归涂口宿郁林寺道玄上人院二首 一 · 许浑","name":"将归涂口宿郁林寺道玄上人院二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西岩一磬长，僧起树苍苍。\n开殿洒寒水，诵经焚晚香。\n竹风云渐散，杉露月犹光。\n无复重来此，归舟凌夕阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}